    "Rules: core's puzzle, platformer and strategy modules (src/puzzle, src/platformer, src/strategy) and their directors (src/game-engine/logic/{Puzzle,Platformer,Strategy}Director.ts), unchanged by this corpus; their predicate packs are pinned clause by clause by conformance/prolog/mechanic-{puzzle,platformer,strategy}.json.",
